            <div xml:id="d3">

                <pb facs="0125" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg1"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/10801: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wallace</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-12-17T21:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                                1920—9 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 18—1:40
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>2021. Your telegram 1703, December 15. A brief warning period would be desirable.
                    It might be provided by fixing a future date after which we would withdraw from
                    the Conference. If you should <pb facs="0126" n="2" xml:id="pg2"/> so direct, I
                    would notify the titular president of the Conference, Monsieur Leygues, and
                    simultaneously inform my colleagues informally of Department’s decision. I
                    should like to receive instructions concerning any explanatory statements you
                    wish me to make, especially to the press, unless the formal note to the
                    president contains reason for our action in withdrawing. I ask earnestly that
                    you make no final decision before you receive personal letter<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d3-f1"/> forwarded in today’s poach and containing considerations I
                    believe to be of greatest importance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wallace</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
